Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:03.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is Brimful. Here's how\Nsaving together works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tap Together, start a shared jar\Nand pick a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,An apartment, $5,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,You get one invite link.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:13.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send it to your partner or friends,\Nup to six people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:15.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'll drop in $25.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:20.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,And when Sara adds $50 from her phone,\Nit shows up live, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:24.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everyone's share, in one jar.\NBrimful Plus · $7 once.
